# Scoops a cargo canister. It starts from scooping-a-canister.cdr (Tools/PrepareCommanders.py): the commander
# mining-laser.replay starts from, with fuel scoops and a mining laser, but with the random state 277,169 draws on,
# which spawns a barrel 9,000 units ahead in the first second of space. Steered to pass under the nose, at full speed
# until 2,000 units off and then slower, it is scooped (TryScoopObject): a random product, alloys this time, into the
# hold. The draw count was found by a search of 1,000 counts for the soonest barrel scooped; the flight was played by
# the scratch program mining-laser.replay's was, and what it pressed is recorded here.
file JAMESON.CDR scooping-a-canister.cdr
wait 0.5; key space; wait 3.5      # any key: the credits, then the status screen
key Escape; wait 0.3               # the disc menu
key l; wait 0.3                    # Load Commander: it asks for a file name
key j; key a; key m; key e; key s; key o; key n; key Return; wait 0.5
